// ============================================================================
// Interactions in the deep ground (Chapter 2): one knot per interactable in
// src/data/areas/borderland/deepGround.ts. Draft text for the designer to rewrite.
// ============================================================================

=== deep_ground_grooves ===
Lines in the ground, dead straight, running away as far as you can see.
Something made them. Something big.
-> END

=== deep_ground_marker ===
The clan's sign, with a bar through it. Stones laid in a line across the ground.
No further.
-> END

=== deep_ground_search_sled ===
{ deep_ground_search_sled > 1:
    You leave the rest. It isn't yours.
- else:
    A sled, sitting in one of the grooves, still loaded. Good finds, tied down tight.
    The pull rope lies out ahead of it, towards the marker, as if whoever was pulling just let go.
    Nobody's come back for it. Nobody's taken from it either.
}
-> END

=== deep_ground_old_marker ===
Another marker, lying flat in the dust. The same sign, worn almost smooth.
It's further out than the one standing. The line used to be here.
-> END

=== deep_ground_posts ===
Posts. Tall, smooth, all the same height, standing in a line beside the grooves, as straight as they are.
On one of them, right at the top, a small light. Cyan. Still on.
-> END

=== deep_ground_beyond ===
More of the same, all the way to the edge of the world. The lines go on without you.
-> END
